# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the audio test binaries. One reason per entry; add nothing without one.
# Anything not named here -- every leak in engine code -- is still reported.

# libpipewire loads its protocol and SPA plugin modules while a stream's context is made and keeps their allocations until the
# process exits (they are the library's own, and the library stays loaded). Seen through pw_context_load_module on every
# pw_stream_new_simple. CAVEAT: this also covers a leak the engine's own PipeWire code might make through the library; the
# device is covered by the hardware tests in the plain and TSan flavors and by review.
leak:libpipewire
